What is it that you are looking for? Just heavy mail traffic?
I guess what you like to know is a mailing list that in general
discusses linux problems. Here at vger it's all splitted into topics. 
There are several other mailing list a vger.kernel.org. Each and every one 
discusses another topic about linux. For example there is linux-net and
linux-admin and so on.

Send an email to majordomo@vger.kernel.org with "lists" in the body of the
mail to get a list of all mailing lists.

Besides mailing lists there are also several newsgroups in usenet where there
is very heavy traffic.

Hope this helped you a little bit,
regards,
